WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Is this the underworld?

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,680
Am I going to die now?

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,560
I'm still so young and I'm not willing to give in

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:11,680
The underworld has been so warm

5
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:16,010
Even the ground you are lying on is hot. You are not dead.

6
00:00:16,760 --> 00:00:19,920
Mou Chuan, why are you here?

7
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:21,590
Are you dead too?

8
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,840
Mou Chuan brother

9
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,000
I haven't eaten for several days

10
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:36,800
Can you share some meat with me?

11
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:51,780
We don’t have enough food for ourselves without your share
